== /security-review fbc1c8c1..87c519ad ==
No vulnerabilities found. Deploy tasks: every subprocess call passes an argument list, no shell=True; the project id comes from the task's own directory name inside one argv element; the credential check prints only variable names, never values; the pnpm exec wrangler / npx wrangler fallback is unchanged from bash. Icon tasks: SVG paths reach node through env vars; one node script puts the tempfile path inside a JS string literal as the bash version did (TMPDIR control out of scope); output only to fixed names under <project>/public; no eval or deserialization. check.ts rules 11 and 17: stricter linting only. Markdown prose excluded.
